  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5809ba33377a94617bbcc465",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由10多场决出“世界最强”的\n国际GⅠ赛事组成的梦幻祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f6c76d5208f5b2ca0c3aa30241cac2125839ede2b5bd10a479c91c7cdc8cea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3ace48752b68d94ca3846ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一边怀揣着“总有一天我也要”的念头，\n一边始终在等待着那个机会的到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26de428bb3541cafcc725ff75c00b8bdf153fdf0b63ba30fe305066ae58bb7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca9a982b28b426b157c54078",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但胜者却总是美国和欧洲等强国",
      "source_fingerprint": "0146c05393a589820be416759718094d162ee59389c5a9fd84c6f69ad0fb91d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:338bb27eba1bf17893ac3eb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那有别于『凯旋门赏』与迪拜GⅠ的\n速度感与规模感令粉丝们为之着迷，\n更是将众多赛马娘推上了明星的宝座。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f95a6407762c1ed53c45b5859b615a2917a30396e5d163308ad0c887dd7f0201",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9142f616c58427583e9a12e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——如果能和负责的赛马娘一同向\n这道高墙发起挑战……并且获得胜利的话。\n如果能亲眼见证抓住荣耀的那一瞬间的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd308359bb943a840ea05e2a25336d6f383ea34d6360fd408e346be893cd18e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f17fae05eb39d3642d2e9c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怀着这样的心愿，\n我一直在等待着不知何时会到来的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2eb467f4cdcc586fc6de94871b8c6fb290da1365f98d8a14be03bde5f53f1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbd21df7d3d19b56904f7fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够抓住这个机会的，只有现在了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad849a7f6c4dcb239066f4bebc3dc47c9191adc573166da0e3467fee11d1ef3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133b344d282eb6570831c123",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在今天，曾挑战过那道高墙的赛马娘——\n夺金旅途带着挑战的门票出现了。\n在那个瞬间，我确信了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8f4406689a58b3384890ce61e15fa91fba73f23c8bf4fb4b93d4423a62690d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae19f3bdaed0388d26e128d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "非常抱歉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9a868e90772bc76121aa99d2eb2f5f639d8a698a2cfdcc881fcdf6418036e72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967f8c4c25c86493ac1a06ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd9417f008c51e87288a0a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以你才——按捺不住焦急的心情\n直接冲进了理事长室啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab02bae7d4a39bb5edacc448c87aaee7babe03b26f86242d82979c313cad3fc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c474340c25d2ae1c230e8ae5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。只要能与拥有当地经验的你组队的话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2cae47d2b9ad72cc5fa9bac2c8a00444e60f53d7eebf5501087b2eb75a9c15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf24d77de153f01afeb5128",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夺金旅途",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bbda5954931205d2dfd81e20488d5353e7c76b9f462d09ffc9b6a33a9e24e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80da6f0efa854235d7d2431b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……那么我确认一件事。你会像那位记者\n一样，对实现的可能性抱有疑问吗？\n面对世界的强敌，你会有所迷茫吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8b1de53f3dc8d93b18387cc75dabaa3c6495a3ba68925ad09d6e44c727d3ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0013/storytimeline_400013000.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
