      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但也应该先决定好目标赛事。\n毕竟赛事的条件本身大体相同，\n中间的目标也会根据它而发生改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009601b8237d9cd5cbe8f4d31db7b1cbd33d243811369b954757f4645f677e1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
